<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Meridian Tackle Co. — Rods & Tackle, Tested Where It Counts</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700;9..144,900&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
 
  :root{
    --navy:#0F2A35;
    --teal:#1D4E52;
    --paper:#EDEFE9;
    --paper-dim:#E1E4DA;
    --brass:#A9793C;
    --brass-light:#C9A46B;
    --rust:#8C4A2F;
    --ink:#14201C;
    --line: rgba(20,32,28,0.16);
    --line-strong: rgba(20,32,28,0.32);
  }
 
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    margin:0;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  .mono{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.16em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--rust);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0.6rem;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:"";
    width:22px;
    height:1px;
    background:var(--rust);
    display:inline-block;
  }
  a{color:inherit;}
  img,svg{display:block;max-width:100%;}
  .wrap{
    max-width:1180px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 32px;
  }
  button, .btn{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.82rem;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    cursor:pointer;
    border:none;
    border-radius:2px;
    padding:14px 26px;
    transition:transform .15s ease, background .2s ease, color .2s ease;
    text-decoration:none;
    display:inline-block;
  }
  .btn-fill{
    background:var(--navy);
    color:var(--paper);
  }
  .btn-fill:hover{background:var(--rust);}
  .btn-outline{
    background:transparent;
    color:var(--navy);
    border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  .btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--navy);}
 
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation:none !important; transition:none !important; scroll-behavior:auto !important;}
  }
 
  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  header{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(237,239,233,0.92);
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:20px 0;
  }
  .brand{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    line-height:1;
  }
  .brand .name{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:1.3rem;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }
  .brand .sub{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.62rem;
    letter-spacing:0.18em;
    color:var(--rust);
    margin-top:3px;
  }
  .navlinks{
    display:flex;
    gap:34px;
    font-size:0.9rem;
  }
  .navlinks a{text-decoration:none; color:var(--ink); opacity:0.75; transition:opacity .15s;}
  .navlinks a:hover{opacity:1;}
  .navcta{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:26px;}
  .menu-toggle{display:none;}
 
  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding:88px 0 60px;
  }
  .hero-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap:56px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.4rem, 4.4vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height:1.05;
    margin:18px 0 22px;
    max-width:14ch;
  }
  .hero p{
    font-size:1.05rem;
    line-height:1.6;
    color:rgba(20,32,28,0.78);
    max-width:44ch;
    margin-bottom:34px;
  }
  .hero-actions{display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .rod-diagram{width:100%; height:auto;}
 
  /* ---------- TRUST BAR ---------- */
  .trustbar{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:22px 0;
  }
  .trustbar .wrap{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  }
  .trustbar .item{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.78rem;
    text-align:center;
    padding:0 16px;
    border-left:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .trustbar .item:first-child{border-left:none;}
  .trustbar .item b{color:var(--navy); display:block; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:0.82rem;}
 
  /* ---------- SECTION HEADS ---------- */
  section{padding:96px 0;}
  .sec-head{
    max-width:640px;
    margin-bottom:56px;
  }
  .sec-head h2{
    font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.4rem);
    margin-top:14px;
  }
  .sec-head p{
    margin-top:16px;
    color:rgba(20,32,28,0.7);
    line-height:1.6;
    font-size:1rem;
  }
 
  /* ---------- HANGTAG CARDS (signature element) ---------- */
  .tag-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:30px;
  }
  .tag-card{
    position:relative;
    background:var(--paper-dim);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:34px 26px 26px;
    transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
  }
  .tag-card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow:0 18px 34px rgba(15,42,53,0.12);
  }
  .tag-hole{
    position:absolute;
    top:16px; left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    width:14px; height:14px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--paper);
    border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  .tag-string{
    position:absolute;
    top:-16px; left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    width:1px; height:16px;
    background:var(--line-strong);
  }
  .tag-card .stitch{
    position:absolute; inset:8px;
    border:1.5px dashed var(--line-strong);
    border-radius:8px;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .tag-name{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:1.3rem;
    font-weight:600;
    margin:10px 0 4px;
  }
  .tag-type{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.7rem;
    letter-spacing:0.1em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--rust);
  }
  .tag-specs{
    margin:20px 0;
    padding-top:16px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    row-gap:10px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.78rem;
  }
  .tag-specs .k{color:rgba(20,32,28,0.55);}
  .tag-specs .v{text-align:right; color:var(--navy);}
  .tag-price{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    margin-top:22px;
  }
  .tag-price .amount{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:1.5rem;
    font-weight:600;
    color:var(--navy);
  }
 
  /* ---------- LURE GRID ---------- */
  .lure-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:22px;
  }
  .lure-card{
    background:var(--navy);
    color:var(--paper);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:26px 22px;
    min-height:170px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:space-between;
    transition:transform .2s ease;
  }
  .lure-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);}
  .lure-card .lname{font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:600;}
  .lure-card .lnote{font-size:0.85rem; line-height:1.5; color:rgba(237,239,233,0.72); margin-top:10px;}
  .lure-card .ltag{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:0.66rem; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--brass-light);}
 
  /* ---------- CRAFT SECTION ---------- */
  .craft{
    background:var(--teal);
    color:var(--paper);
  }
  .craft .eyebrow{color:var(--brass-light);}
  .craft .eyebrow::before{background:var(--brass-light);}
  .craft-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:60px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .craft h2{color:var(--paper); font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.3rem); margin-top:14px;}
  .craft p{color:rgba(237,239,233,0.8); line-height:1.7; margin-top:18px; max-width:46ch;}
  .knot-diagram{width:100%; height:auto;}
 
  /* ---------- STEPS ---------- */
  .steps{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:40px;
  }
  .step{
    border-top:2px solid var(--navy);
    padding-top:20px;
  }
  .step .num{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.78rem;
    color:var(--rust);
  }
  .step h3{
    font-size:1.2rem;
    margin:10px 0 10px;
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .step p{
    font-size:0.92rem;
    line-height:1.6;
    color:rgba(20,32,28,0.7);
  }
 
  /* ---------- CTA / VISIT ---------- */
  .visit{
    background:var(--navy);
    color:var(--paper);
    border-radius:18px;
    margin:0 32px;
    padding:64px 56px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap:48px;
  }
  .visit h2{color:var(--paper); font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.3rem);}
  .visit .eyebrow{color:var(--brass-light);}
  .visit .eyebrow::before{background:var(--brass-light);}
  .visit-details{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    line-height:2;
    color:rgba(237,239,233,0.85);
    margin-top:22px;
  }
  .newsletter{
    align-self:center;
    background:rgba(237,239,233,0.06);
    border:1px solid rgba(237,239,233,0.18);
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:30px;
  }
  .newsletter p{
    font-size:0.85rem;
    color:rgba(237,239,233,0.75);
    margin:0 0 16px;
    line-height:1.5;
  }
  .newsletter form{display:flex; gap:10px;}
  .newsletter input{
    flex:1;
    padding:12px 14px;
    border-radius:4px;
    border:1px solid rgba(237,239,233,0.25);
    background:transparent;
    color:var(--paper);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size:0.88rem;
  }
  .newsletter input::placeholder{color:rgba(237,239,233,0.45);}
 
  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  footer{
    padding:56px 0 40px;
  }
  .footer-grid{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:flex-start;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:24px;
    padding-bottom:28px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .footer-links{display:flex; gap:30px; font-size:0.88rem;}
  .footer-links a{text-decoration:none; opacity:0.75;}
  .footer-links a:hover{opacity:1;}
  .footer-bottom{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding-top:24px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    color:rgba(20,32,28,0.5);
  }
 
  /* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */
  @media (max-width:900px){
    .navlinks{display:none;}
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:40px;}
    .trustbar .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:14px;}
    .trustbar .item{border-left:none; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:14px;}
    .trustbar .item:first-child{border-top:none;}
    .tag-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .lure-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .craft-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .visit{grid-template-columns:1fr; padding:40px 26px; margin:0 16px;}
    .wrap{padding:0 20px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
 
<header>
  <nav class="wrap">
    <div class="brand">
      <span class="name">MERIDIAN</span>
      <span class="sub">TACKLE CO.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="navlinks">
      <a href="#rods">Rods</a>
      <a href="#bait">Bait &amp; Lures</a>
      <a href="#craft">Craft</a>
      <a href="#visit">Visit</a>
    </div>
    <div class="navcta">
      <a class="btn btn-fill" href="#rods">Shop Rods</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>
 
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Precision Tackle · Est. 1994</span>
      <h1>Built for water that doesn't forgive mistakes.</h1>
      <p>Meridian rods and tackle are tested on the rivers and flats where they're sold — not in a lab three states away. If it doesn't hold up on our local water, it doesn't go on our shelf.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-fill" href="#rods">Shop Rods</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#bait">Shop Bait &amp; Lures</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <svg class="rod-diagram" viewBox="0 0 480 380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <line x1="60" y1="330" x2="430" y2="40" stroke="#14201C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="60" y1="330" x2="430" y2="40" stroke="#A9793C" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="1 5" opacity="0.6"/>
        <circle cx="120" cy="286" r="5" fill="none" stroke="#14201C" stroke-width="1.6"/>
        <circle cx="190" cy="228" r="4.3" fill="none" stroke="#14201C" stroke-width="1.4"/>
        <circle cx="260" cy="170" r="3.6" fill="none" stroke="#14201C" stroke-width="1.3"/>
        <circle cx="330" cy="112" r="3" fill="none" stroke="#14201C" stroke-width="1.1"/>
        <circle cx="390" cy="64" r="2.4" fill="none" stroke="#14201C" stroke-width="1"/>
        <rect x="42" y="316" width="52" height="26" rx="4" fill="#8C4A2F" transform="rotate(-24 68 329)"/>
        <circle cx="98" cy="300" r="20" fill="none" stroke="#A9793C" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <line x1="430" y1="40" x2="452" y2="150" stroke="#1D4E52" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
        <path d="M452 150 q 6 20 -8 32" stroke="#1D4E52" stroke-width="1" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
        <line x1="120" y1="286" x2="30" y2="286" stroke="#14201C" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/>
        <text x="10" y="282" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#14201C" text-anchor="start">LENGTH: 7'6"</text>
        <line x1="260" y1="170" x2="200" y2="130" stroke="#14201C" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/>
        <text x="150" y="126" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#14201C" text-anchor="start">ACTION: FAST</text>
        <line x1="390" y1="64" x2="390" y2="24" stroke="#14201C" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/>
        <text x="330" y="18" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#14201C" text-anchor="start">PIECES: 2</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
 
<div class="trustbar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="item"><b>Hand-Inspected</b>Every rod, every reel, before it ships</div>
    <div class="item"><b>30-Day Water Test</b>Fish it. Love it, or bring it back.</div>
    <div class="item"><b>Family-Run</b>Three generations on this river</div>
  </div>
</div>
 
<section id="rods">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">The Rods</span>
      <h2>Three actions. One standard.</h2>
      <p>Every Meridian rod is built around a single job: matching what you're chasing to how it fights. No filler lineup, no gimmicks — just the actions we'd hand a friend.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tag-grid">
 
      <div class="tag-card">
        <div class="tag-string"></div><div class="tag-hole"></div><div class="stitch"></div>
        <span class="tag-type">Spinning Rod</span>
        <div class="tag-name">The Drift</div>
        <div class="tag-specs">
          <span class="k">Length</span><span class="v">7'0"</span>
          <span class="k">Power</span><span class="v">Medium</span>
          <span class="k">Action</span><span class="v">Fast</span>
          <span class="k">Pieces</span><span class="v">2</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tag-price"><span class="amount">$189</span><a class="btn btn-outline" href="#visit">Inquire</a></div>
      </div>
 
      <div class="tag-card">
        <div class="tag-string"></div><div class="tag-hole"></div><div class="stitch"></div>
        <span class="tag-type">Casting Rod</span>
        <div class="tag-name">The Current</div>
        <div class="tag-specs">
          <span class="k">Length</span><span class="v">7'3"</span>
          <span class="k">Power</span><span class="v">Med-Heavy</span>
          <span class="k">Action</span><span class="v">Fast</span>
          <span class="k">Pieces</span><span class="v">1</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tag-price"><span class="amount">$229</span><a class="btn btn-outline" href="#visit">Inquire</a></div>
      </div>
 
      <div class="tag-card">
        <div class="tag-string"></div><div class="tag-hole"></div><div class="stitch"></div>
        <span class="tag-type">Fly Rod</span>
        <div class="tag-name">The Meridian Fly</div>
        <div class="tag-specs">
          <span class="k">Length</span><span class="v">9'0"</span>
          <span class="k">Weight</span><span class="v">5wt</span>
          <span class="k">Action</span><span class="v">Med-Fast</span>
          <span class="k">Pieces</span><span class="v">4</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tag-price"><span class="amount">$349</span><a class="btn btn-outline" href="#visit">Inquire</a></div>
      </div>
 
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
 
<section id="bait" style="background:var(--paper-dim);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Bait &amp; Lures</span>
      <h2>Whatever's biting today.</h2>
      <p>Our tackle wall changes with the season and the water report — this is the core of what's always stocked.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lure-grid">
      <div class="lure-card">
        <span class="ltag">Hard Bait</span>
        <div><div class="lname">Crankbaits</div><div class="lnote">Deep-diving to topwater, tuned to a specific running depth.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="lure-card">
        <span class="ltag">Soft Bait</span>
        <div><div class="lname">Soft Plastics</div><div class="lnote">Worms, craws, and swimbaits rigged weightless or Texas-style.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="lure-card">
        <span class="ltag">Terminal Tackle</span>
        <div><div class="lname">Jigs &amp; Spinnerbaits</div><div class="lnote">Bottom-bouncing to blade-flash, tied by hand in-house.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="lure-card">
        <span class="ltag">Fresh &amp; Frozen</span>
        <div><div class="lname">Live &amp; Cut Bait</div><div class="lnote">Minnows, nightcrawlers, and cut bait — restocked every morning.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
 
<section id="craft" class="craft">
  <div class="wrap craft-grid">
    <div>
      <svg class="knot-diagram" viewBox="0 0 360 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M60 240 C 60 180, 140 180, 140 140 C 140 100, 60 100, 60 60" fill="none" stroke="#EDEFE9" stroke-width="2"/>
        <path d="M60 240 C 60 180, 140 180, 140 140 C 140 100, 60 100, 60 60" fill="none" stroke="#C9A46B" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="1 5"/>
        <circle cx="60" cy="240" r="3" fill="#EDEFE9"/>
        <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="3" fill="#EDEFE9"/>
        <line x1="140" y1="140" x2="230" y2="140" stroke="#EDEFE9" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/>
        <text x="240" y="144" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#EDEFE9">CLINCH KNOT</text>
        <line x1="60" y1="60" x2="230" y2="40" stroke="#EDEFE9" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/>
        <text x="240" y="44" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#EDEFE9">TESTED: 12LB TEST</text>
        <line x1="60" y1="240" x2="230" y2="260" stroke="#EDEFE9" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/>
        <text x="240" y="264" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#EDEFE9">HELD: 200+ CASTS</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Since 1994</span>
      <h2>Tested where it counts, not just in the shop.</h2>
      <p>Meridian started as a bait shop on the county road, run out of the back of a truck on weekends. Every rod we carry gets cast on our stretch of river before it's stocked — if the guides ice up wrong or the tip's too soft for a hookset, it doesn't make the wall.</p>
      <p>Three generations later, that's still the only quality test that matters to us.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
 
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
